# Delta

@leather-5@Math@ !!=O#Delta# is a math workspace in the ribbon style, or in its original Delta Classic look. It has a live graphing calculator, a LaTeX renderer and a calculator!

[Open Delta](/delta) · [Phone version](/delta/mobile/)

| Tab | Use it for |
| --- | --- |
| ++T$:Graph++ | Plot equations as you type. Add @marble-4@sliders@ for values you want to change, use %%L+lists%%, and draw @retrodesk-1@polygons@ |
| ++L>LaTeX++ | Write LaTeX and see it drawn, ready to copy into a document |
| ++C-(Calculator++ | Everyday and scientific calculations |
| ++GL0}Share++ | Share & Chat, for working on a graph together |

::tip Math in documents
Writeout, Bitbook and OpenDB draw math from `$x^2$` and `$$ ... $$`, using KaTeX. Delta's LaTeX tab is a good place to try an equation before pasting it!
::end
